### Adventurers’ Guild (refined)

It is not a separate organization with its own master.  
It is the **freelancer branch of Cedric’s military**.

- Registered parties are irregulars under the Bear’s authority.  
- Contracts are military/security work farmed out to people the city does not want on the permanent payroll.  
- Discipline, blacklisting, and priority of work all flow from Cedric’s office.  
- The Guildhall wing is simply the public-facing desk and board for that irregular force.

Same logic applies across the board: the council members *are* the operational heads. No extra layer.

